          "items": [
            "HOME HIGHLIGHTS:<br>- Gulf front home with private beach boardwalk<br>- Steps from the beach<br>- Private pool *Complimentary Pool heating is available October 1 through May 1st.<br>- 6 Passenger Low-Speed Vehicle<br>- Peloton<br>- Firetable<br>- 6 adult bikes<br>- Elevator<br>- Shuffleboard<br>- Complimentary beach setups each morning include 4 beach chairs with 2 umbrellas (Mar 1-Oct 31)<br>- Complete Clean Linen Participant - All linens, including comforter covers, are laundered upon every checkout<br><br>DETAILS: 74 Emerald Cove Lane is an immaculate Gulf-front escape ideally nestled in the coastal beauty of Inlet Beach. With its inviting emerald waters and powdery sands only steps away, this private oasis provides the ultimate recipe for relaxationâ€”a beach chair, sunscreen, and a captivating book. Boasting 6 bedrooms, 6 full bathrooms, and 3 half baths, this beach retreat is perfect for large groups or families, sleeping up to 18 guests.<br><br>Step inside this 4-story home, where custom light fixtures and expansive Gulf-facing windows cast a warm, inviting glow throughout the first floor. Every corner is adorned with meticulously selected elements that elevate it to a true work of art. Guests are greeted by a spacious living area that seamlessly flows out to a private beachfront pool and sun-soaked deckâ€”alongside a fully-equipped kitchen and breakfast bar, boasting direct access to the pool deck.<br><br>An in-home elevator takes guests to the second floor, where a pristine, neutral palette envelopes each room, allowing the natural beauty of the area to take center stage. With its gentle, muted tones that exude a calming sophistication, the second-floor primary offers breathtaking sunrises and sunsets from the walkout balcony, as well as a king bed and private bathroom with a soaking tub. Down the hall lies a washer and dryer, along with 2 lovely guest bedrooms with private bathroomsâ€”one features 2 queen beds and the other a queen bed and private balcony.<br><br>Enjoy direct access to the expansive beachfront balcony from the third-floor great room, which effortlessly merges the primary living, dining, and kitchen spaces. Sink into plush seating while marveling at the bespoke fixtures in the stylish living area, where large windows frame awe-inspiring Gulf views. Restful nights await in the comfy guest bedroom, boasting a queen bed and private bathroom.<br><br>Wake up to breathtaking coastal views from the top-floor primary bedroom, featuring a spacious king bed and private bathroom with a soaking tub. A wet bar opens onto the fourth-floor covered deck with a fire table and seating. This floor also includes a bunk room with 2 twin-over-queen beds and a laundry room.<br><br>Discover all the comforts and luxuries this home has to offer! With on-site parkingâ€”plus a 6-seater Low-Speed Vehicle and 6 adult bikesâ€”itâ€™s easy to explore Scenic 30A. For beach access, simply take the private boardwalk off the back of this Gulf-front home. Book this serene getaway today!<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS: (SLEEPS 18):<br>SECOND FLOOR:<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower/Tub Separate<br>- Guest Bedroom: Queen, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br>- Guest Bedroom: Two Queen Beds, Private Bathroom with Shower/Tub Combo<br><br>THIRD FLOOR:<br>- Guest Bedroom: Queen Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower Only<br><br>FOURTH FLOOR:<br>- Primary Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower/Tub Separate<br>- Guest Bedroom: Two Twin-over-Queen Bunk Beds, Private Bathroom with Shower Only",
